unk_id": "MS_10K_2025-12-31__mdna__0336", "ticker": "MS", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-12-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.5424, "filing_name": "Morgan Stanley 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/895421/000089542126000086/ms-20251231.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "MS_10K_2025-12-31__mdna__0264", "ticker": "MS", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-12-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.5271, "filing_name": "Morgan Stanley 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/895421/000089542126000086/ms-20251231.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "MS_10K_2025-12-31__mdna__0235", "ticker": "MS", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-12-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.3149, "filing_name": "Morgan Stanley 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/895421/000089542126000086/ms-20251231.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 61, "dropped_candidates": 618, "token_estimate": 31969, "gaps": [], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "JPMorgan (10-K FY2025, ended December 31, 2025) says it may earn higher net interest income when rates are high or increasing, but higher rates could also bring fewer real estate loan originations, deposit loss and AFS securities losses [JPM_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0028]. Bank of America (10-K FY2024, ended December 31, 2024) says higher rates have generally helped net interest income but have hurt investment securities, deposits, loan demand and funding costs [BAC_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0003]. Morgan Stanley (10-K FY2025, ended December 31, 2025) says its net interest income is sensitive to rate changes, and it also describes trading and non-trading interest rate risk [MS_10K_2025-12-31__unknown__0075] [MS_10K_2025-12-31__mdna__0225]. Goldman Sachs (10-K FY2024, ended December 31, 2024) has no chunk that describes interest rate risk directly; i